al_untouched/418/1046211.jpg"},"summary":"<p>A terrible calamity has fallen onto Zhang Fan, not only becoming one of the three survivors of Grass Temple Village, where everyone else was horribly massacred, he was also tasked to carry one of the most evil artifacts, the Sinister Bead, and taught one of the most secret teachings of the Skysong Sect, the Brahmin Wisdom. Now he cultivates in the Jadeon Sect, his knowledge and possession will draw him into a chaotic story where he will have to carry some of the greatest burdens of the Martial World.</p>","updated":1787337140,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/63490"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3708446","name":"Episode 16"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3708447","name":"Episode 17"}}}}},{"id":3826700,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/episodes/3826700/still-a-family-1x18-episode-18","name":"Episode 18","season":1,"number":18,"type":"regular","airdate":"2026-11-26","airtime":"20:00","airstamp":"2026-11-26T12:00:00+00:00","runtime":46,"rating":{"average":null},"image":null,"summary":null,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3826700"},"show":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/86090","name":"Still a Family"}},"_embedded":{"show":{"id":86090,"url":"https://www.tvmaze.com/shows/86090/still-a-family","name":"Still a Family","type":"Scripted","language":"Chinese","genres":["Drama","Comedy","Family"],"status":"Running","runtime":null,"averageRuntime":46,"premiered":"2026-11-16","ended":null,"officialSite":"https://v.qq.com/x/cover/mzc002006266llu.html","schedule":{"time":"20:00","days":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday","Saturday","Sunday"]},"rating":{"average":null},"weight":55,"network":{"id":1282,"name":"CCTV-1","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":null},"webChannel":{"id":104,"name":"Tencent QQ","country":{"name":"China","code":"CN","timezone":"Asia/Shanghai"},"officialSite":"https://v.qq.com/"},"dvdCountry":null,"externals":{"tvrage":null,"thetvdb":null,"imdb":null},"image":{"medium":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_portrait/651/1629770.jpg","original":"https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/original_untouched/651/1629770.jpg"},"summary":"<p>In 2008, with China's economy booming, the Sai Duoxi family living on the Jiaodong Peninsula undergoes a dramatic change. A large demolition compensation payment puts the family's old troubles and chronic problems on full display. Sai Duoxi, a domineering and authoritarian father, throws his children's lives into chaos as he fights to preserve his rule over the household. The five pairs of sons and daughters in the Sai family are five different portraits of life. A sudden turn of events then shakes Sai Duoxi's status as \"head of the family,\" while the five pairs of children begin to reconsider the family's generational relationships and confront their own life dilemmas. Ultimately, the Sai family comes to understand that a home is a place of equality and dignity, and that love means family reunion.</p>","updated":1795637748,"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/shows/86090"},"previousepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3826699","name":"Episode 17"},"nextepisode":{"href":"https://api.tvmaze.com/episodes/3826700","name":"Episode 18"}}}}}]}